      "vipId": "PA166169439",
      "vipSummary": {
        "id": 1448638925,
        "html": "<p>The 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl coenzyme A (HMG-CoA) reductase enzyme (EC 1.1.1.88) catalyzes the NADP-dependent conversion of HMG-CoA to mevalonate in the rate-limiting step of cholesterol biosynthesis, and is the target of the statin family of cholesterol lowering drugs.</p>\n",
